            "Long ago, in a certain village, there lived a girl named Kongjwi, who had to live alone with her father after her mother passed away early. Her father remarried, and his new wife had a daughter named Patjwi. The stepmother and Patjwi pretended to be affectionate on the surface, but in truth they hated Kongjwi bitterly.",
