            "When Shim Cheong threw herself into the sea, the Dragon King was moved by her filial devotion and took her to his underwater palace, where he cared for her tenderly. Some time later, the Dragon King placed her inside a great lotus flower and sent it floating back up to the surface of the sea. Fishermen who happened to be passing by found the lotus flower and presented it to the emperor.",
            "Emerging from the lotus flower, Shim Cheong captured the emperor's heart with her beauty and wisdom and became empress. As empress, Shim Cheong gathered all the blind people in the country for a great feast, hoping to find her father. At last, when her father met his daughter at the feast, he was so astonished and overjoyed that his eyes suddenly opened.",
